		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Char-fleshed pixie with bat wings and features. Hunts pixies, nixies, and other tiny fey. Carries enchanted soul- stealing faerie skulls.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 4, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 claw +1 (1) or soul skull, <strong>MV</strong> near (climb, fly), <strong>S</strong> -2, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +0, <strong>I</strong> +1, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> -1, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 1</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Invisibility</strong>. Turn invisible. Ends if pixie attacks.</p><p></p><p><strong>Soul Skull</strong>. Throws soul- stealing faerie skull. WIS 9+ or chaneque controls until the skull is destroyed. Can only control one being at a time, must hold skull.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
